  "headCont": "생물구성다양성",
  "contentval": "0000Ezzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz",
  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHu/14",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: start;\">김지은 선생님이 올려주신 아래 링크의 뽀로로 친척찾기 활동을 수정하여 수업하였습니다. 좋은 자료를 올려주셔서 감사합니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><a style=\"color: #0070d1;\" href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/1290\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">재미있는 과학수업 만들기 | 뽀로로 친척찾기 활동지 - Daum 카페</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/1290\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=cen&amp;datanum=1290\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/1290\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/1290\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p>저희 학교는 1단원-&gt;3단원-&gt;2단원 순으로 수업을 진행하는데...</p><p>3단원인 생물다양성 단원을 마치고 공개수업 주간이 겹쳐 본 활동을 진행하게 되었습니다.</p><p>학생들도.. 학부모님들도 즐거워 하셨어요.^^</p><p>&#160;</p><p>미술 시간에 이미 &#39;뤼튼&#39;이라는 chat gpt 비슷한 어플을 깔아놓은 상태여서</p><p>&#160;</p><p>이 어플을 이용하여 학생들이 검색한 후, 조별로 패들렛에 게시하고 발표시켰습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>학생들이 활동한&#160; 패들렛 주소도 게시합니다.(현재 패들렛을 동결시킨 상태입니다.)</p><p><a href=\"https://padlet.com/god3na/padlet-ik58wsxs6f0voezp\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://padlet.com/god3na/padlet-ik58wsxs6f0voezp</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"뽀로로 친척찾기\" data-og-description=\"우리 함께 뽀로로와 친구들의 친척을 찾아보아요&#128522;\" data-og-host=\"padlet.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://padlet.com/god3na/padlet-ik58wsxs6f0voezp\" data-og-url=\"https://padlet.com/god3na/padlet-ik58wsxs6f0voezp\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bt4ieJ/hyWdlUftOH/dgsleqaXLO9ZSzid0NVdF0/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_1200_600,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cW09Kj/hyWdquuTxz/zJ8XlQ9z02cONk1nD1zk7K/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_1200_600\"><a href=\"https://padlet.com/god3na/padlet-ik58wsxs6f0voezp\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://padlet.com/god3na/padlet-ik58wsxs6f0voezp\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bt4ieJ/hyWdlUftOH/dgsleqaXLO9ZSzid0NVdF0/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_1200_600,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cW09Kj/hyWdquuTxz/zJ8XlQ9z02cONk1nD1zk7K/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_1200_600\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">뽀로로 친척찾기</p><p class=\"og-desc\">우리 함께 뽀로로와 친구들의 친척을 찾아보아요&#128522;</p><p class=\"og-host\">padlet.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>수업 한 PPT자료와 폰트, 학습지가 담긴 구글드라이브 주소를 공유합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>폰트를 깔아야 학습지와 PPT가 깨지지않고 보입니다.^^</p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1A3ZLM7jIGBAvY80YtNXbbIO2_Ij02ZlT?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1A3ZLM7jIGBAvY80YtNXbbIO2_Ij02ZlT?usp=sharing</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Google Drive: 로그인\" data-og-description=\"이메일 또는 휴대전화\" data-og-host=\"accounts.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1A3ZLM7jIGBAvY80YtNXbbIO2_Ij02ZlT?usp=sharing\" data-og-url=\"https://accounts.google.com/v3/signin/identifier?continue=https%3A%2F%2Fdrive.google.com%2Fdrive%2Ffolders%2F1A3ZLM7jIGBAvY80YtNXbbIO2_Ij02ZlT%3Fusp%3Dsharing&amp;followup=https%3A%2F%2Fdrive.google.com%2Fdrive%2Ffolders%2F1A3ZLM7jIGBAvY80YtNXbbIO2_Ij02ZlT%3Fusp%3Dsharing&amp;ifkv=AS5LTARXfKjEL62fheuM0iwFyiGmStw_G0AiC3ea5A6X8HbpRGOtCBlcWJboMYs6ETELaXwqgcJNpQ&amp;osid=1&amp;passive=1209600&amp;service=wise&amp;flowName=WebLiteSignIn&amp;flowEntry=ServiceLogin&amp;dsh=S-1761414396%3A1717117953706513\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1A3ZLM7jIGBAvY80YtNXbbIO2_Ij02ZlT?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1A3ZLM7jIGBAvY80YtNXbbIO2_Ij02ZlT?usp=sharing\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Google Drive: 로그인</p><p class=\"og-desc\">이메일 또는 휴대전화</p><p class=\"og-host\">accounts.google.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그럼 재미있는 수업 하세요~^^</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
